"evidence":["houzhu-q-O085"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houzhu-q-O085","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-72cfc8a8795122c12087","layer":"original","quote":"食邑万户，赐绢万匹，奴婢百人，他物称是〖44〗；子孙为三都尉、封侯者五十余人〖45〗。尚书令樊建、侍中张绍、光禄大夫谯周、秘书令郤正、殿中督张通〖46〗，并封列侯。﹝一﹞","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o088a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-352840fe8fe246488eae","layer":"original","quote":"董厥者，丞相亮时为府令史〖1〗，亮称之曰：“董令史，良士也。吾每与之言，思慎宜适〖2〗。”徙为主簿。亮卒后，稍迁至尚书仆射。代陈祗为尚书令〖3〗。迁〔辅国〕大将军，平台事〖4〗。而义阳樊建代焉。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":437,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o088b-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-352840fe8fe246488eae","layer":"original","quote":"延熙（二）十四年，以校尉使吴；值孙权病笃〖5〗，不自见建。权问诸葛恪曰：“樊建何如宗预也〖6〗？”恪对曰：“才识不及预，而雅性过之。”后为侍中，守尚书令〖7〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":437,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":100,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o090a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-1d0877cbf2a1516f2355","layer":"original","quote":"蜀破之明年春，厥、建俱诣京都，同为相国参军〖9〗；其秋并兼散骑常侍，使蜀慰劳〖10〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":439,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-p055a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-bb98d1ff8c6148865f3b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“樊建为给事中，晋武帝问诸葛亮之治国。建对曰：‘闻恶必改，而不矜过；赏罚之信，足感神明。’帝曰：‘善哉！使我得此人以自辅，岂有今日之劳乎？’建稽首曰：‘臣窃闻天下之论，皆谓邓艾见枉，陛下知而不理；此岂冯唐之所谓“虽得颇、牧而不能用”者乎！’帝笑曰：‘吾方欲明之，卿言起我意。’于是发诏（治）〔理〕艾焉。”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e9dee84ff5b911a43efe","start":0,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-f0014-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-3406c6235d4ec9ae7056","layer":"pei","quote":"建字长元","attribution":"《晋百官表》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":452,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d2a6b00b60221b3a977c","start":23,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o088","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-352840fe8fe246488eae","layer":"original","quote":"董厥者，丞相亮时为府令史〖1〗，亮称之曰：“董令史，良士也。吾每与之言，思慎宜适〖2〗。”徙为主簿。亮卒后，稍迁至尚书仆射。代陈祗为尚书令〖3〗。迁〔辅国〕大将军，平台事〖4〗。而义阳樊建代焉。﹝一﹞延熙（二）十四年，以校尉使吴；值孙权病笃〖5〗，不自见建。权问诸葛恪曰：“樊建何如宗预也〖6〗？”恪对曰：“才识不及预，而雅性过之。”后为侍中，守尚书令〖7〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":437,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o089","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-8ad10299db2621d1c503","layer":"original","quote":"自瞻、厥、建统事，姜维常征伐在外，宦人黄皓窃弄机柄；咸共将护〖8〗，无能匡矫，﹝二﹞然建特不与皓和好往来。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o090","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-1d0877cbf2a1516f2355","layer":"original","quote":"蜀破之明年春，厥、建俱诣京都，同为相国参军〖9〗；其秋并兼散骑常侍，使蜀慰劳〖10〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":439,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-p053","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-3406c6235d4ec9ae7056","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞按《晋百官表》：“董厥字龚袭，亦义阳人。建字长元。”","attribution":"《晋百官表》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":452,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d2a6b00b60221b3a977c","start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-p055","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-bb98d1ff8c6148865f3b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“樊建为给事中，晋武帝问诸葛亮之治国。建对曰：‘闻恶必改，而不矜过；赏罚之信，足感神明。’帝曰：‘善哉！使我得此人以自辅，岂有今日之劳乎？’建稽首曰：‘臣窃闻天下之论，皆谓邓艾见枉，陛下知而不理；此岂冯唐之所谓“虽得颇、牧而不能用”者乎！’帝笑曰：‘吾方欲明之，卿言起我意。’于是发诏（治）〔理〕艾焉。”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e9dee84ff5b911a43efe","start":0,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
